{"text":"Not when you can't begin to forget the word that scars like a beat. The letters in themselves, assassins of dark meat. After all, they say murder in Mississippi is just another word for Monday. America. If we haven't heard her, her name is murder, born black into a back that chewed her. It is a different word in were the intruders. It sleeps in the word swollen from a pride that is not ego, but ego we throw to the clouds like a fist, enlisting the word in each row of bare teeth beneath the gum. The word thrums and trembles like a pit of pity, don't it? We've been buried, but despite the shooting, the looting, they wonder why eludin we grows to the sky eludin we goes, we the proud word for highfaludin negros.","words":[{"text":"Not","start":0.0,"end":0.4},{"text":"when","start":0.4,"end":0.58},{"text":"you","start":0.58,"end":0.72},{"text":"can't","start":0.72,"end":1.1},{"text":"begin","start":1.1,"end":1.5},{"text":"to","start":1.5,"end":1.74},{"text":"forget","start":1.74,"end":2.08},{"text":"the","start":2.08,"end":2.38},{"text":"word","start":2.38,"end":2.62},{"text":"that","start":2.62,"end":2.82},{"text":"scars","start":2.82,"end":3.18},{"text":"like","start":3.18,"end":3.46},{"text":"a","start":3.46,"end":3.62},{"text":"beat","start":3.62,"end":3.84,"punct":"."},{"text":"The","start":4.28,"end":4.5},{"text":"letters","start":4.5,"end":4.78},{"text":"in","start":4.78,"end":5.04},{"text":"themselves","start":5.04,"end":5.48,"punct":","},{"text":"assassins","start":5.7,"end":6.16},{"text":"of","start":6.16,"end":6.78},{"text":"dark","start":6.78,"end":7.04},{"text":"meat","start":7.04,"end":7.32,"punct":"."},{"text":"After","start":7.44,"end":7.72},{"text":"all","start":7.72,"end":8.14,"punct":","},{"text":"they","start":8.58,"end":8.74},{"text":"say","start":8.74,"end":9.04},{"text":"murder","start":9.04,"end":9.46},{"text":"in","start":9.46,"end":9.86},{"text":"Mississippi","start":9.86,"end":10.36},{"text":"is","start":10.36,"end":10.9},{"text":"just